#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:59 086419f73a284a3f9155d9b28a7b13b2
msgid "Subnet Mask and Gateway"
msgstr "子网掩码与网关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:61 45bc9da3b0604e1295d7e9ceb72188c7
msgid ""
"The subnet mask limits the IP addresses that the autopilot may directly "
"communicate with."
msgstr "子网掩码限制了飞控可直接通信的 IP 地址范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:63 042afea3a54c432596ba3db92e04a839
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_NETMASK<NET_NETMASK>` is the number of leading bits set in the "
"subnet mask. For example, if set to 24 (the default) then the subnet mask is"
" 255.255.255.0."
msgstr ""
":ref:`NET_NETMASK<NET_NETMASK>` 为子网掩码前导位数。例如，若设为 24（默认值），则子网掩码为 "
"255.255.255.0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:65 9b7d599cb42f45b586a4840e87bc6d1a
msgid ""
"The gateway IP address is used for routing when communicating with IP "
"addresses out of the local subnet defined by "
":ref:`NET_NETMASK<NET_NETMASK>`. Any destination IPs that are outside the "
"masked subnet range will be sent to the gateway's MAC address with the final"
" destinations IP address. The default is ``192.168.144.1``."
msgstr ""
"网关 IP 地址用于在与 :ref:`NET_NETMASK<NET_NETMASK>` 定义的本地子网之外的 IP "
"地址通信时进行路由。任何不在子网范围内的目标 IP 数据包将发送至网关的 MAC 地址，并携带最终目标 IP 地址。默认值为 "
"``192.168.144.1``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:67 629c4aa6fd614aa8bd1a8e529c76f03f
