#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:75 d23dc165baab48c185d7d9adb8aa225b
msgid "PPP Configuration"
msgstr "PPP 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:77 b00b9626e1d14d96948c62217f35d6c5
msgid ""
"This feature allows any H7 cpu-based autopilot to connect to networks via a "
"Serial port using PPP. This can be to a serial PPP device or to an :ref:`PPP"
" to Ethernet Adapter <common-ethernet-adapters>`."
msgstr ""
"此功能允许任何基于 H7 CPU 的飞控通过串口使用 PPP 连接至网络。可连接至串口 PPP 设备或 :ref:`PPP 转以太网适配器 "
"<common-ethernet-adapters>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:79 4e0ce424f0be47cab09fe56491f2cc7a
msgid ""
"this cannot be used with autopilots having a built-in Ethernet MAC. Only one"
" network connection per autopilot is allowed currently. Also, only one "
"serial port on the autopilot can be configured for PPP."
msgstr "此功能不能用于内置以太网 MAC 的飞控。目前每台飞控只允许一个网络连接，且只能有一个串口被配置为 PPP。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:81 09ef61d7ddc643a8b5f1902cd00a50ed
msgid ""
"To enable this feature, it first must be present in the autopilot firmware. "
"This can be done using the `Custom Firmware Build Server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ or by building the code locally using "
"the \"\\-\\-enable-PPP\" waf configuration option (See :ref:`building-the-"
"code`)"
msgstr ""
"要启用此功能，首先需要将其包含在飞控固件中。可使用 `自定义固件构建服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ "
"或在本地使用 「\\-\\-enable-PPP」 waf 配置选项构建代码（参见 :ref:`building-the-code`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:86 79195780c85240ceb43f93153158e353
msgid ""
"Connect one of the H7 based autopilot's serial ports to the ethernet "
"switch's or Ethernet-to-PPP-adapter's USART port. For optimum performance a "
"serial port with flow control should be used (e.g. normally SERIAL1 or "
"SERIAL2).  If a port without flow control if used, the baud rate may be set "
"as high as 921000"
msgstr ""
"将 H7 飞控的某个串口连接到以太网交换机或以太网转 PPP 适配器的 USART 端口。为获得最佳性能，应使用支持流控的串口（通常为 SERIAL1 "
"或 SERIAL2）。若使用不带流控的端口，波特率最高可设置为 921000。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:88 9729f2c95c8b4259a8d67124ab4fd82e
msgid ""
