"used with the \"pppd\" software. An example of the command to run this is:"
msgstr "另外，任何带 UART（或 USB 转 UART）的 Linux 计算机均可配合 「pppd」 软件使用。运行示例命令如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:94 33b8428f97294a0a8c9a482752f03fc6
msgid ""
"The above command will take the incoming stream from /dev/ttyAMA0 (at a "
"12.5M Baudrate) destined for 192.168.144.15 (the local IP of pppd) and "
"defines the remote (the flight controller) as 192.168.144.14."
msgstr ""
"上述命令将来自 /dev/ttyAMA0（波特率 12.5M）、目标地址为 192.168.144.15（pppd 本地 "
"IP）的数据流传输，并将远端（飞控）定义为 192.168.144.14。"

