#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:123 ec083f869b804a689775d56469657159
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>`: Type can be disabled (0), UDP Client (1), "
"UDP Server (2), TCP Client (3), or TCP Server(4). For the two client types a"
" valid destination IP address must be set. For the two server types either "
"0.0.0.0 or the autopilot's local IP address can be used. The UDP client type"
" will use broadcast if the IP is set to 255.255.255.255 and will use UDP "
"multicast if the IP is in the multicast address range. A reboot is required "
"to see the following parameters once the TYPE is set."
msgstr ""
":ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>`：类型可以是 禁用(0)、UDP 客户端(1)、UDP 服务器(2)、TCP 客户端(3)"
" 或 TCP 服务器(4)。两种客户端类型均需设置有效的目标 IP 地址。两种服务器类型可使用 0.0.0.0 或飞控本机 IP。UDP 客户端若 IP"
" 设为 255.255.255.255 则使用广播，若 IP 在组播地址范围内则使用 UDP 组播。设置 TYPE 后需重启才能看到后续参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:124 3f5e9eedf5cc4f14b65036de0d1a0a3c
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>`, :ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>`, "
":ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>`, :ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>`:IP address for "
"outgoing packets from Clients. Can be 0.0.0.0 or the autopilot's IP address "
"for Servers. A reboot is required after changing."
msgstr ""
":ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>`：客户端出包的目标"
" IP 地址。对于服务器，可使用 0.0.0.0 或飞控本机 IP。修改后需重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:125 e493ec9cc748407f8f42addd751d7025
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>`: This is the TCP or UDP port number. Reboot "
"required after changing."
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>`：TCP 或 UDP 端口号，修改后需重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:126 ad42cc2ad9d64efa9556b9d34ec3e831
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>`: This registers this port with the "
"ArduPilot Serial Manager as having a device attached which uses the "
"specified protocol. This allows ArduPilot to use the data as if it had come "
"from a UART attached device or connection. A reboot is required after "
"changing."
msgstr ""
":ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>`：将该端口在 ArduPilot "
"串口管理器中注册为使用指定协议的设备连接，使 ArduPilot 能像处理 UART 连接设备的数据一样处理该端口数据。修改后需重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:128 db40565639d44a848aff240bdb5208a4
msgid ""
"The figure below shows a typical single device setup for an Ethernet gimbal."
msgstr "下图展示了以太网云台的典型单设备配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:132 7d5cc8c8592a42d3a530a9322fdda477
msgid ""
"The figure below shows a typical vehicle system with multiple peripherals "
"and an optional ground-based connection to a factory network for data "
"retrieval and vehicle setup."
msgstr "下图展示了一个典型的多外设飞行器系统，以及可选的与工厂地面网络的连接（用于数据采集和飞行器设置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:137 a7447a3373a5408680f81d15ddf0814d
msgid "Server or Client?"
msgstr "服务器还是客户端？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:139 4a03764117e54ba1a7dea6fb5f37dd2d
msgid ""
"The choice of client or server is determined by the capabilities of the "
"device being connected. If it is a TCP server, then ArduPilot's port should "
"be a TCP Client. If its a UDP Client, then ArduPilot would be a UDP Server."
msgstr ""
"客户端或服务器的选择取决于所连接设备的能力。若设备是 TCP 服务器，则 ArduPilot 端口应设为 TCP 客户端；若设备是 UDP 客户端，则 "
"ArduPilot 应设为 UDP 服务器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:141 3bf36b3184344324bba970a170745385
msgid ""
"In general if a device is a controllable object to the autopilot, it would "
"be a server, always listening for commands (ESC, Gimbal,etc.). If a "
"continuous data stream (like an airspeed sensor), it would probably be a "
"client, able to send data without inquiry."
msgstr ""
"通常，若设备是受飞控控制的对象（如 "
"ESC、云台等），则设为服务器，始终监听命令。若为连续数据流（如空速传感器），则可能设为客户端，能主动发送数据而无需查询。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:144 b32d38577bbd49239662574bd3d9d627
msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:146 f573230295bb4fb68f6be4fe56ba826d
msgid ""
"Network access to LUA scripts is provided with several `socket style "
"bindings "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/d90224280e416d0475eaadd06648bbf0daab7f7d/libraries/AP_Scripting/docs/docs/docs.lua>`__"
"  (search for \"socket\") that allows the script to connect and manage UDP "
"or TCP data flow to the network from the script."
msgstr ""
"通过多个 `socket 风格绑定 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/d90224280e416d0475eaadd06648bbf0daab7f7d/libraries/AP_Scripting/docs/docs/docs.lua>`__"
" （搜索 「socket」）可为 LUA 脚本提供网络访问，允许脚本连接并管理与网络之间的 UDP 或 TCP 数据流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:148 4f86a3d1db9b444f9391595f7021a813
msgid ""
"An example script implementing a simple web server application on the "
"autopilot which allows access to the SD card (for rapid log downloading), "
"and access to autopilot state(arming and GPS/AHRS location in this example) "
"is available `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/net_webserver.lua>`__"
" and its `readme file here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/net_webserver.md>`__"
msgstr ""
"一个在飞控上实现简单 Web 服务器应用的示例脚本可在 `这里 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/net_webserver.lua>`__"
" 找到，支持访问 SD 卡（用于快速日志下载）以及访问飞控状态（本示例中为解锁状态和 GPS/AHRS 位置）。其 `readme 文件在此 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/net_webserver.md>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:151 5c7cce7ee3514af2a784ab768d22de60
msgid "Running the Webserver Script Under SITL"
msgstr "在 SITL 下运行 Web 服务器脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:153 53e3f61689d84fef9f4ab4f1a643f7fa
msgid "run SITL"
msgstr "运行 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:154 eebd088e27a64213ad4da29ed29f5333
msgid "enable scripting (:ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` = 1), reboot SITL"
msgstr "启用脚本（:ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` = 1），重启 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:155 7715f0e2ded44034a47cade98c0b1267
msgid "set :ref:`SCR_VM_I_COUNT<SCR_VM_I_COUNT>` = 1000000, reboot SITL"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SCR_VM_I_COUNT<SCR_VM_I_COUNT>` = 1000000，重启 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:156 32eff6104ba8439ebe36c460849d7f58
msgid ""
"connect local webrowser to \"http://127.0.0.1:8080\" (not types as shown to "
"avoid https)"
msgstr "用本地浏览器访问 「http://127.0.0.1:8080」（注意不要使用 https）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:158 36f3e964261144eba8fce37aaede8d74
msgid "Resulting web page"
msgstr "生成的网页"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:163 e13b9c42d98444ab8c16642fb8033636
msgid "Connecting to Webserver via Network Attached Autopilot"
msgstr "通过网络连接的飞控访问 Web 服务器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:164 515f05fea58d4219b97299c9675c4fa7
msgid ""
"In order to connect an autopilot running the webserver to the local network "
"to allow other PCs to access the server:"
msgstr "要将运行 Web 服务器的飞控连接到本地网络，允许其他 PC 访问："

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:166 d677aa45d8954812859ee2db7b591ef8
msgid ""
"connect autopilot to the local network (directly or via Ethernet switch)"
msgstr "将飞控连接到本地网络（直连或通过以太网交换机）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:167 f678d7e252ec46adb9a8cfd9197a472c
msgid ""
"make sure ``NET_IPADDR`` is an address within the local network range or use"
" the network DHCP server to set it if using the Ethernet interface. For PPP "
"configurations the connected PPP access peripheral should be already setup "
"for network operation as required, and its PPP daemon should have an arp "
"proxy runniing."
msgstr ""
"确保 ``NET_IPADDR`` 在本地网络范围内，若使用以太网接口也可通过网络 DHCP 服务器进行分配。对于 PPP 配置，所连接的 PPP "
"访问外设应已完成网络运行所需的设置，且其 PPP 守护进程应已运行 arp proxy。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:168 1eb4e04a38754996bb0a92ebe3bae445
msgid ""
"connect local webrowser to \"http://<NET_IPADDR>:8080\" (note: type exactly "
"as shown... \"https://\" will not work)"
msgstr "用本地浏览器访问 「http://<NET_IPADDR>:8080」（注意：请严格按所示输入……「https://」 无效）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:171 33426685fe4c47f2a26e60c82d0ea33f
msgid "Cable Adapters, Cabling, and Wiring"
msgstr "电缆适配器、走线与接线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:173 b101fe2e233b464e81ab06654455b461
msgid ""
"Most Ethernet devices are interconnected with CAT5 (or higher) cables with "
"RJ-45 connectors. These connectors are obviously too bulky for use on an "
"autopilot or vehicle Ethernet switches. Instead 4 or 5 pin JST-GH or "
"Picoblade connectors are used. See the :ref:`Ethernet adapters <common-"
"ethernet-adapters>` page for a list of known devices"
msgstr ""
"大多数以太网设备使用带 RJ-45 接头的 CAT5（或更高规格）线缆互连。这类接头对于飞控或飞行器以太网交换机来说体积过大。因此改用 4 或 5 针 "
"JST-GH 或 Picoblade 接头。已知设备列表见 :ref:`以太网适配器 <common-ethernet-adapters>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:175 71b918397fa34c21b74f4f9bf79699fe
msgid ""
"Using full CAT5 cables to interconnect vehicle components for longer runs "
"may be required, but runs 1-2 meters or less can be done with two twisted "
"pairs of 22-24 AWG wire. Runs from autopilot to switch and to peripherals "
"may all be implemented with short twisted pair runs and JST-GH/Picoblade "
"connectors."
msgstr ""
"较长连接可能需要使用完整的 CAT5 线缆，但 1-2 米以内的连接可用两对 22-24 AWG "
"双绞线实现。飞控到交换机及各外设的连接均可使用短双绞线配 JST-GH/Picoblade 接头完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:178 83247994baec481fb27c86f1d06e6a9f
msgid "Example Ethernet Connected Vehicle System"
msgstr "以太网连接飞行器系统示例"
